{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04385","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 十一 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱鬼谷子，青谿无垢氛。\n囊括经世道，遗身在白云。\n七雄方龙鬬，天下久无君。\n浮荣不足贵，遵养晦时文。\n舒可弥宇宙，卷之不盈分。\n岂徒山木寿，空与麋鹿羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}